{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aa3d5848-6667-8e79-94e2-0396a8d79ce4",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T10:05:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:03:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good morning, Rosa. Nelson Amaral here. I think I may have the wrong number, to tell you the truth. I was trying to get whoever handles the trees."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, trees. Is something down, or is there an emergency?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:04:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nothing's fallen, thank God. Everything's standing. It's just there's a city tree out front of the house, and the branches are getting low. I'd like to ask about trimming it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:04:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So it's one of the street trees, between the sidewalk and the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:04:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am, right at the curb. It's not mine, it's the city's. I rent, so I wouldn't want to go cutting on anything that isn't mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. You're right not to touch it. That would go to the Department of Public Services, they handle the city trees. I can transfer you over, or I can give you the number for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Transfer me, please, that'd be easier. I've got the phone stuck to my ear here, and I've still got my gloves on. I just came in off the bike."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:04:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you bike in this weather? It's February."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:05:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every day, all year round, to work and back. These big heavy gloves, you can hardly feel the buttons on the phone. Ha. But the branches are right about at head height on the bike path side, so that's why I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense, that's a good reason to call. Okay, let me put you through. If it drops, call back and ask for Public Services."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:05:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Services. Got it. I'll remember that. You were very kind, Rosa, thank you for not hanging up on an old man."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Never. Hold on one moment, Mr. Amaral, I'm connecting you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:05:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, dear. You have a nice Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T10:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
